ick Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T09:57:28-07:00","id":1091990,"title":"","content":"Yeah as you gain nightmare, and it reaches ten it causes an inbalance with your willpower leading to bedlam more or less.. it would be nice to easier track that i think","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T10:49:11-07:00","id":1092008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1091333#post1091333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey...not to derail the thread too bad...but...<br /> <br /> Is there anything that's not on the sheet that y'all would like to see? I'll be using my Changeling 4 page sheet as my base, but if there is anything that changed in C20 that isn't on the sheet that should be, let me know. For now, I'll try to start work on an unofficial version until I can get a hold of the proper graphics and stuff....</div> </div> </div> </div>Well it should be a small box, there are already soo many boxes. Maybe you can use da:fae mists (the circle one) for banality and glamour. It would give some sense of releive to below section. 3 lines for glamour banality and willpower, and now we have nightmare. Maybe glamour and banality will be circular, willpower as normal. Nightmare should also above willpower (IN my taste of course) <br /> <br /> Imbalance box could be a little boxes just above circles. weapon boxes are important. Also, I admire your shadow sheet in wraith, could you do such a thing for chimeras?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7562-kokorowatari","name":"KokoroWatari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-13T12:54:27-07:00","id":1092061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CameraObscura83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1091990#post1091990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah as you gain nightmare, and it reaches ten it causes an inbalance with your willpower leading to bedlam more or less.. it would be nice to easier track that i think</div> </div> </div> </div>So, how does the imbalance affect your willpower?<br /> <br /> Anyway, I'd think some boxes above the dots should be doable...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KokoroWatari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1092008#post1092008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well it should be a small box, there are already soo many boxes. Maybe you can use da:fae mists (the circle one) for banality and glamour. It would give some sense of releive to below section. 3 lines for glamour banality and willpower, and now we have nightmare. Maybe glamour and banality will be circular, willpower as normal. Nightmare should also above willpower (IN my taste of course)</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been cooking up a mock-up using my existing Changeling sheets, so I'll post it before too long. I just did normal trackers for Glamour and Banality. Might be interesting to use the one from DA Fae, but could eat up a bit of room, that was good size if I remember right...been a bit since I've looked at that sheet though. And I currently have Nightmare under willpower, but I suppose it could be moved.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KokoroWatari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1092008#post1092008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Imbalance box could be a little boxes just above circles.</div> </div> </div> </div> For willpower, right?)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KokoroWatari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1092008#post1092008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">weapon boxes are important.</div> </div> </div> </div>My 4 page sheet has a weapons section. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KokoroWatari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1092008#post1092008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I admire your shadow sheet in wraith, could you do such a thing for chimeras?</div> </div> </div> </div>I did one for the old Changeling: <a href=\"