o people think Mr Gone's Chimera sheets will still work with C20? I think they will, but I wanted to check.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I used it recently for my troll's infant gryphon. It still works swell, there's just some Abilities that don't apply in the new edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13420-gl1tterboots","name":"gl1tterboots","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-15T14:11:12-07:00","id":1092950,"title":"","content":"Mr Gone, im not sure what platform you use but im a wiz with photoshop if you need help with this (this is not saying you aren't capable, jsut that id be happy to help!) ?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T04:31:28-07:00","id":1093179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CameraObscura83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1092563#post1092563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kinda like the new look with banality at the bottom?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've always had it at the bottom on my sheets. So, just wondered if it should stay there. Sounds like it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CameraObscura83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1092950#post1092950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mr Gone, im not sure what platform you use but im a wiz with photoshop if you need help with this (this is not saying you aren't capable, jsut that id be happy to help!) ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh cool, thanks for the offer. I use Acrobat to put all my sheets together, but I sometimes I have to use Photoshop to spruce up some graphics here and there. So, I might could use your help possibly. Got some ideas?<br /> <br /> Oh...I did have someone tell me they though the Chimerical health levels could look different, like sparkly or something along those line. That sounds like a job for photoshop... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gl1tterboots</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1092786#post1092786\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I used it recently for my troll's infant gryphon. It still works swell, there's just some Abilities that don't apply in the new edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh cool, glad to hear it still works ok. Maybe I can see about sprucing it up by updating the abilities and such....<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T10:52:41-07:00","id":1093332,"title":"","content":"OOh thats not a bad idea, I hadnt thought of anything specifically but id be happy to help, i'll DM you my email!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T16:22:12-07:00","id":1093441,"title":"","content":"Hey Mr. Gone, instead of more damn boxes for the tracking of imbalance, could you maybe put capital letter I under the boxes for temporary Willpower? Make them stylized, yellow or red, sparkles or a very Changeling or Celtic font would be lovely.<br /> Otherwise I love the idea of adding at least two more translucent dots to every Attribute and same with Chimerical health boxes.<br /> Otherwise everyone's ideas have been stunning an awesome!!<br /> Keep up the excellent work boyos!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1697-lostkith","name":"Lostkith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1697_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T17:41:37-07:00","id":1093467,"title":"","content":"The problem with that is Imbal;ance will shift a capitol letter cant move on a paper sheet. but that does make me wonder what the best way TO show Imbalance is.... *scratches chin*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-16T17:53:48-07:00","id":1093472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CameraObscura83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1093332#post1093332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OOh thats not a bad idea, I hadnt thought of anything specifically but id be happy to help, i'll DM you my email!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks!<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lostkith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1093441#post1093441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey Mr. Gone, instead of more damn boxes for the tracking of imbalance, could you maybe put capital letter I under the boxes for temporary Willpower? Make them stylized, yellow or red, sparkles or a very Changeling or Celtic font would be lovely.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CameraObscura83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1093467#post1093467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problem with that is Imbal;ance will shift a capitol letter cant move on a paper sheet. but that does make me wonder what the best way TO show Imbalance is.... *scratches chin*</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I guess on an interactive sheet, I could make that a type in text field, and add the letter, then people could just add spaces to shift it. The only problem might be it's possible the spaces wouldn't line up good with the boxes, so it might be too offset to be of use.<br /> <br /> But, I'm not sure what the best way would be...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lostkith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090022-unofficial-interactive-c20-character-sheet?p=1093441#post1093441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Otherwise I love the idea of adding at least two more translucent dots to every Attribute and same with Chimerical health boxes.<br /> Otherwise everyone's ideas have been stunning an awesome!!<br /> Keep up the excellent work boyos!!</div> </div> </div> </div>Have to see what I can do. The only problem we might have in doing translucent dots or boxes is that they're so small on the sheet they might not look too good. Acrobat isn't the best when it comes to rendering small graphics. But, we'll just have to see how it goes...<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> BTW, for now, here is the sheet I've been working on. It's just done with the old Changeling 2nd ed Borders and stuff for now, till I can get some better graphics. Though, I had someone ask me to just go ahead and use the low-res graphics from the sheet in the book. So, I'll work on that sometime soon<br /> <br /> Anyway, here's the link for the work-in-progress version:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/C20_4-Page_Unofficial_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/C20_4-Page_Unofficial_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> 404 Not Found </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/C20_4-Page_Unofficial_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/misc/C20_4-Page_Unofficial_Interactive.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I have not made any of the requested changes here yet...so I apologize for that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-m